            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Petitioner, the case concerns whether the Railroad Retirement Board\u2019s final decisions are subject to judicial review under Section\u202f355(f) of the Railroad Unemployment Insurance Act."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Petitioner",
        "citations": [
