              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 4,
                "start": 4
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Petitioner, section\u202f355(f) subjects any final decision of the Railroad Retirement Board to judicial review."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Petitioner",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "990193c52e02034416020633723d2ee2612a185b13b567f909aff449d36a0991",
